---
// Dove Star Health - Home Page
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Dove Star Health</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        color: #1a1a2e;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a6e7c, #14b8a6);
        color: white;
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
      nav a {
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-left: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .hero {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a6e7c, #14b8a6);
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
      }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: white;
        color: #0a6e7c;
        padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 50px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
      .section {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
      }
      .section h2 {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: #0a6e7c;
      }
      .features {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      .feature {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #f0fdfa;
      }
      .feature h3 { color: #0a6e7c; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .feature p { color: #555; font-size: 0.95rem; }
      footer {
        background: #1a1a2e;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        nav { display: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">🕊️ Dove Star Health</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Your Health, Our Priority</h1>
      <p>Compassionate, personalized care for you and your loved ones. Building healthier lives, one step at a time.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555;">
        Dove Star Health is dedicated to providing quality healthcare with a personal touch.
        We believe everyone deserves access to compassionate, professional care that puts their needs first.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="services">
      <h2>Our Services</h2>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>General Care</h3>
          <p>Comprehensive health check-ups and ongoing wellness support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>Preventive Health</h3>
          <p>Screenings and guidance to keep you healthy and ahead of issues.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>Personalized Plans</h3>
          <p>Tailored health plans designed around your unique needs and goals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555;">
        Email: info@dovestarhealth.com<br />
        We're here to help you on your health journey.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2026 Dove Star Health. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
